  "implementation": [
    "Each of the five shared Stores admits exact sizeof(Retained<Mutex<T>>) plus one root before Arc allocation. Context clones share these guards; dynamic children keep separate existing admission. Partial construction releases every prior Store.",
    "Detached project preparation receives only ApplicationSessions plus immutable target identity and accepted Snapshot. It constructs independent Stores on that same canonical budget. Explicit receiver/preview/profile/project constructors avoid unused worker bootstrap hosts.",
    "Three queued Retained editor wrappers are boxed, making their actual storage separate from fixed PreparedModels. Adapters unbox before existing adoption. Original take-before-attach order prevents target Store-to-model-to-same-Store cycles.",
    "Fixtures construct Stores on the intended host instead of replacing Context.application. Measured live-Context and host-only baselines follow actual alias lifetimes; scientific, pressure, generation, pointer identity, no-overwrite and final-drop assertions remain."
  ],
